      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORSON ROCKET (1) was below best at his last start when 6th at Grafton following a third place finish (17.37) at this track two back. Form here at the trip sound including seven wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. FEDERAL ESCAPE (7) did a good job to finish second last time out over 300m at this track (17.13) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Can turn it around this time. ANNOYING ACES (2) finished well back at this track last time when a 11 length eighth (17.82) but scored five back at this track (17.39). The form out of last race has been strong. Has ability and can measure up. LITTLE DULCIE (4) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
